{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1191101-tier-3-talent-homebrew-help","id":1191101,"title":"Tier 3 Talent Homebrew help","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-02T13:21:31-08:00","id":1191101,"title":"Tier 3 Talent Homebrew help","content":"I want to offer the players of Talents something they strive toward that allows them to remain on par with the Psions in the group, who are going to rush toward Proxy Tier.<br /> They've said Tier 3 talents will be a thing but haven't been written yet so until then how would you handle them until something more concrete comes out.<br /> <br /> Firstly the drop in Target number to 7.<br /> Then a bump in the return of Inspiration after it is spent. Maybe one for every 30 minutes of meditation.<br /> Facets allowed to go to 6 or 7<br /> And some gifts or an expansion to Dramatic Editing.<br /> <br /> I would say once you've reached this point you are aware of what you are doing, you no longer think in terms of I'm just lucky but rather you see the twisting of luck and drawing from other continuums that are possible through Dramatic Editing.<br /> <br /> Comments or ideas welcome...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1383,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1383-yrtalien","user":"yrtalien","date":". 03-02-2018, 05:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1383-yrtalien","name":"yrtalien","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T07:07:24-08:00","id":1191610,"title":"","content":"If Facets are allowed to go up to 6 or 7, I'm guessing that a 7 gives you a fourth dot of Inspiration, letting your total go as high as 13. <br /> <br /> I think the main difference is going to lie in the Gifts: where the normal Gifts we see for Talents push the envelope of coincidence (for Luck Gifts) or competence (for Aptitude Gifts), their Tier 3 counterparts should go over the top.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 03-04-2018, 11:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T11:59:07-08:00","id":1191702,"title":"","content":"Some thoughts.<br /> <br /> I agree, Facets up to 7, dot 7 gives another dot of Inspiration.<br /> <br /> All Attributes can go up to 6, if you have the Superior Trait edge that Att goes to 7.<br /> <br /> As Dataweaver says, you definitely need new gifts accessible only to tier 3 Talents.<br /> <br /> Some ideas:<br /> Skill category gifts that grant so many uses of a skill trick without spending momentum, or bonus momentum only for Skill Tricks with that skill.<br /> A gift in each skill category that allows you to raise that skill to 6. The sixth dot grants 2 skill trick slots (Total, up to 5 skill tricks with 6 dots).<br /> Gifts that grant +2 scale to specific tasks.<br /> <br /> Gifts that grant larger bonuses - +3 soft armor. Gifts that grant extra health levels.<br /> <br /> New class of abilities - Inspired Skill Tricks. Counts as a Gift and a Skill Trick, costs 5xp, high entry reqs (4-5 dots in the skill, possibly other specific skill tricks or gifts).<br /> Grant things like 8-again to a specific roll.<br /> Grant the ability to do things that are literally normally impossible, I.E. Arc a Bullet around a corner with Aim, attach a second head to a body to keep it alive with Medicine, build a bomb with no combustible materials.<br /> <br /> Just some thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T15:28:05-08:00","id":1191759,"title":"","content":"You both have some great ideas. I agree that the place that would need the most attention is Gifts that just plain break the rules","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1383-yrtalien","name":"yrtalien","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}